Z||000000||1FST2M6||08-27-2000||07:12 PM||||ok you'll save a few bucks over chris wests units. thiey are better than poly... I'll get a pick of them in my 87 GT. $125 +shipping...  anyone interested? I know this should be in the mall but it's tech related.. i'm just trying to see if anyone would like a set. thier T6061 Aircraft aluminum, can be anodized for a few bucks more... i was surprised at how it affected the car.. it doesn't shake the mirror or shock the car when you put it in gear.. (i have an automatic) <P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2m6alumcradle.jpg">    <P>and only takes about 3 hours start to finish to put in...   will fit 4, 6, and 8 cyl. (84-87) also thinking about making Dupont Delron sets.<P>comments... questions...<p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 08-27-2000).]||||reg||1
