Z||000008||HYPTNOTiSE||08-27-2000||09:54 PM||||Those pics look of those bushings look different than my bushings that i have.  Mine are unknown in origin.  They're anadised gold.  They have delrin washers.  And, the front bushings have dlrin inserts to prevent any squeek.  I also have a complete set of aluminum control arm bushings with washers.  The bushings are also have delrin inserts with grooves cut in the outside, and the aluminum bushings have holes already tapped for Zerk fittings so they can  be greazed.  That way the delrin moves with the bolt and slides on the nice layer of greese.<P>***Look at that post below! I got it right after about 10 tries!***<p>[This message has been edited by HYPTNOTiSE (edited 08-27-2000).]||||reg||1
